{"2729220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Da Vinci Cryptex 3", "steam_appid": 2729220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras/644ba578c874fbc50933832c33110a71.avif?t=1785763801\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras_big/644ba578c874fbc50933832c33110a71.avif?t=1785763801 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The genial Italian inventor is back with new logical puzzles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the Cryptex by solving the riddles drawn in a book, it seems easy, but you need to use all your brain skills to escape! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras/85da1613a18c43bb19db7d10f8b145d6.avif?t=1785763801\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras_big/85da1613a18c43bb19db7d10f8b145d6.avif?t=1785763801 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Da Vinci Cryptex 3</strong> is a brainteasing game with 50 unique hand-drawn puzzles. The more you crack them, the harder they become</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras/2d62d122eed8f1605d698908d3a38746.avif?t=1785763801\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras_big/2d62d122eed8f1605d698908d3a38746.avif?t=1785763801 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- 50 new unique enigmas that will put your brain to work</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Hints available (click the bulb button to get a hint)</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- A new room you're trapped in </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Captivating background music</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of puzzles, word games, brain thinking, mind games, IQ logic riddles, and enigmas, <strong>The Da Vinci Cryptex</strong> is the game for you, have fun in your spare time!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785763801\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras_big/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785763801 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras/644ba578c874fbc50933832c33110a71.avif?t=1785763801\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras_big/644ba578c874fbc50933832c33110a71.avif?t=1785763801 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The genial Italian inventor is back with new logical puzzles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the Cryptex by solving the riddles drawn in a book, it seems easy, but you need to use all your brain skills to escape! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras/85da1613a18c43bb19db7d10f8b145d6.avif?t=1785763801\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729220/extras_big/85da1613a18c43bb19db7d10f8b145d6.avif?t=1785763801 width=